### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@slug = test-software-engineer
@fingerprint = test-fp-001

### 1. Liste des offres publiques
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs?page=1&limit=20

### 1b. Liste avec recherche full-text
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs?search=engineer&limit=10

### 1c. Liste filtrée par organisation
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs?organizationCode=LYDG

### 2. Détail d'une offre par slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}

### 3. Postuler (cas OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}

{
  "fullName": "Marie Dupont",
  "email": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33612345678",
  "coverLetter": "Je suis très intéressée par ce poste, mon profil correspond.",
  "cvUrl": "https://storage.supabase.co/uploads/cv/marie.pdf",
  "cvMimeType": "application/pdf",
  "cvSizeBytes": 524288,
  "websiteField": ""
}

### 4. Postuler — HONEYPOT (doit retourner 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bot Spammer",
  "email": "bot@spam.com",
  "cvUrl": "https://storage.supabase.co/uploads/cv/bot.pdf",
  "websiteField": "https://spam.com"
}

### 5. Postuler — CV .exe (doit retourner 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "cvUrl": "https://storage.supabase.co/uploads/cv/file.exe"
}

### 6. Postuler — HTTP non-HTTPS (doit retourner 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "cvUrl": "http://insecure.com/cv.pdf"
}

### 7. Postuler — doublon (lancer 2× → 2e = 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/{{slug}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Marie Dupont",
  "email": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "cvUrl": "https://storage.supabase.co/uploads/cv/marie.pdf"
}

### 8. Slug inexistant (doit retourner 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/careers/jobs/this-slug-does-not-exist
